  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (e.g., config_048) achieve high accuracy (0.7207). This experiment tests a similar setup with pca_n2000 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder, using transformer aggregation and weighted fusion. It clarifies whether switching the RNA encoder to pca_n2000 while keeping transformer aggregation and weighted fusion could yield comparable or better performance, balancing exploration of encoder choices with the promising aggregation/fusion strategy."
